  "headline": "FDA's shortage list shows Teva Pharmaceuticals USA, Inc. discontinued metoprolol succinate on 2026-08-31; our labels name NuCare Pharmaceuticals, Inc. (FEI 3003294404) and Bryant Ranch Prepack (FEI 1000519407) as registered plants with recent VAI inspections",
  "headline_cites": ["E24", "E11", "E23"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's shortage list records that Teva Pharmaceuticals USA, Inc. posted a discontinuation of metoprolol succinate on 2026-08-31 with a business decision to discontinue manufacture.",
      "cites": ["E24"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Our product label 4a900d2c identifies NuCare Pharmaceuticals, Inc. (FEI 3003294404) as a registered repack plant whose last inspection was NAI on 2025-03-12.",
      "cites": ["E11"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection records for NuCare show a series of VAI classifications from 2010 through 2020 and a Warning Letter issued on 2019-09-27.",
      "cites": ["E5", "E6", "E7", "E9", "E10"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Our product label 840ac287 identifies Bryant Ranch Prepack (FEI 1000519407) as a registered relabel/repack plant whose last inspection was VAI on 2026-07-16.",
      "cites": ["E23"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection records for Bryant Ranch Prepack include an OAI classification in 2009, a Warning Letter in 2010, and subsequent VAI inspections through 2026.",
      "cites": ["E13", "E22", "E14", "E15", "E16", "E17", "E18", "E19", "E20", "E21"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 425 units at 22.2 per day (19 days on hand) and Corvale General holds 699 units at 27.5 per day (25 days on hand).",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2"]
    }
  ]
}
